{{> company}}

Find and verify these facts about the company:
- website: the official corporate website (home page URL).
- headquarters: address of the global headquarters. Use the full English country name, for example "United States".
- phone: main phone number of the headquarters, in international format.
- headcount: current total number of employees, as one integer.
- annualRevenueUsd: revenue of the most recent fiscal year in US dollars, as one number (not in thousands). Convert other currencies at the exchange rate of the fiscal year end.
- ownershipType: "public" when its shares trade on a stock exchange; otherwise "private", "npo", "education", "government" or "other".
- tickerSymbol: stock ticker on its primary exchange, without the exchange prefix. null when the company is not listed.
- foundedYear: year the company was founded.
